{"ID":"20250917152026-zlpwov1","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250917152026-zlpwov1","title":"UPL5-4——协程相关","type":"doc","updated":"20250917163059"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917152026-jbymwj1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250917152026-jbymwj1","updated":"20250917152338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"协同程序的额外开销"}]},{"ID":"20250917152119-c5p5ql9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917152119-c5p5ql9","updated":"20250917152206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上一章的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Update"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 优化策略当中提到，我们可以通过降低 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Update"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的执行频率以及分帧执行来提升效率\n很容易联想到使用协程来实现这一目的，但是我们当时并没有提及协程"}]},{"ID":"20250917152135-x0b4iw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917152135-x0b4iw4","updated":"20250917152135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要原因就是，使用协程其实会带来一些额外开销，与标准函数调用相比："}]},{"ID":"20250917152122-gjbx6l5","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250917152122-gjbx6l5","updated":"20250917152326"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917152122-jwvrbu4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250917152122-jwvrbu4","updated":"20250917152128"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917152122-nvkhz25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917152122-nvkhz25","updated":"20250917152128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"启动协程会带来额外的开销成本，大约是标准函数调用的 3 倍"}]}]},{"ID":"20250917152122-q1pk8bp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250917152122-q1pk8bp","updated":"20250917152122"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250917152122-2afdony","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250917152122-2afdony","updated":"20250917152122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"启动协程会额外分配一些内存，用于存储当前协程的状态"}]}]},{"ID":"202509